sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Store as Magento / Customer Channel
    participant Profile as Profile Service
    participant APIM as API Management
    participant Fn as Azure Function
    participant DV as Dataverse
    participant Bus as Service Bus
    participant Admin as Admin Backoffice
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Customer->>Store: Submit company registration
    Store->>Profile: Existing registration API (HTTPS)
    Profile->>APIM: Registration command (HTTPS)
    APIM->>Fn: Validate and map request
    Fn->>DV: Upsert Account, Contact and role
    DV-->>Fn: Dataverse record references
    Fn-->>APIM: Registration result
    APIM-->>Profile: Result
    Profile-->>Store: Registration response
    Store-->>Customer: Acknowledge request

    Customer->>Store: Submit KYB information
    Store->>Profile: KYB submission
    Profile->>APIM: Submission command
    APIM->>Fn: Process submission
    Fn->>DV: Create application / submission / metadata
    DV-->>Fn: Saved references
    Fn-->>Profile: Submission accepted
    Admin->>DV: Review application
    Admin->>DV: Record decision and reason
    DV-->>Bus: Publish status-change event
    Bus-->>Fn: Deliver event
    Fn->>Profile: Update existing channel contract
    Fn->>Notify: Request customer notification
